-- Interrupts of the RP2350, from its SVD: vendor Raspberry Pi, version 0.1.
-- SVD SHA-256 f1180d39bbc0e7c01b1a418bc61493c8450e25732f33bf2b0df381255078014c.
-- Copyright (c) 2024 Raspberry Pi Ltd.
