-- Generated from the SVD; memory.ldn beside it is written by hand.
-- The policy adds PROC0_IRQ_CTI at 40: RP2350 Datasheet release 8, 3.2, Table 95, p. 81: IRQ 40 is PROC0_IRQ_CTI, the core 0 cross trigger interface's interrupt, which the SVD omits and pico-sdk's intctrl.h defines.
-- The policy adds PROC1_IRQ_CTI at 41: RP2350 Datasheet release 8, 3.2, Table 95, p. 81: IRQ 41 is PROC1_IRQ_CTI, the core 1 cross trigger interface's interrupt, which the SVD omits and pico-sdk's intctrl.h defines.

